pan>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clamp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(intensity, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100.0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自适应音乐系统通过两种范式让音乐随游戏状态变化：水平切换在段落边界切换整段音乐（需要同步策略），垂直分层通过强度参数实时控制多层轨道音量（即时响应）。Stinger 系统在主音乐上叠加即时事件响应的短促音乐片段。强度值由多个游戏变量加权计算，平滑处理避免音量突变。</p>\n<p><strong>同章节其他内容</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"sound-event-system\">声音事件触发</a> — 自适应音乐的状态切换通过事件系统驱动</li>\n<li><a href=\"realtime-dsp-effects\">实时 DSP 效果</a> — 音乐在播放时可叠加 DSP 效果增强情感渲染</li>\n<li><a href=\"./\">章节总览</a> — 自适应系统与事件三篇文档的学习路径</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自适应音乐系统：水平分层、垂直分层与强度驱动","id":"自适应音乐系统-水平分层-垂直分层与强度驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应音乐的两种范式","id":"自适应音乐的两种范式"},{"level":2,"text":"水平分层：状态段落切换","id":"水平分层-状态段落切换"},{"level":2,"text":"垂直分层：强度参数驱动","id":"垂直分层-强度参数驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"Stinger 系统","id":"stinger-系统"},{"level":2,"text":"强度值的游戏状态映射","id":"强度值的游戏状态映射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"混响与遮挡：早期反射、晚期混响与 Ray-cast 声学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/spatial-audio/reverb-and-occlusion"},"next":{"title":"声音事件触发：Wwise Event、RTPC、Switch 与优先级系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-audio-programming/adaptive-systems/sound-event-system"}}